1 gene with nasopharyngeal swabs</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>2003</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>1909</fpage><lpage>1913</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||97|1909||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12673717</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Henle</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Henle</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EBV-specific IgA serum antibodies as an outstanding feature of NPC</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1976</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Cancer||17|1||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">175020</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Henle</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Henle</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><name><surname>Burtin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Cachin</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Clifford</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>de Schryver</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>de-The</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Diehl</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antibody to EBV in NPC, other head and neck neoplasms and control groups</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1970</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>231</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||44|225||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11515035</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Kwan</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors affecting serum IgA antibody to EBV capsid antigens in NPC</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1978a</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>356</fpage><lpage>362</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||37|356||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">205232</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kwan</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immunohistochemistry of local immunoglobulin production in NPC</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1978b</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>514</fpage><lpage>519</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||37|514||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">348224</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ji</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Guo</surname><given-names>YC</given-names></name><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>WM</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>BH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ou</surname><given-names>XT</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>DK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A dynamic study on EBV VCA IgA and EA IgA in NPC patients</article-title><source>Chinese J Oncol</source><year>2003a</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>245</lpage>[Chinese]<!--PubMed citation query: 'Chinese J Oncol||2