present in cultured Burkitt lymphoma cells</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1966</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>1699</fpage><lpage>1704</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Proc Natl Acad Sci USA||56|1699||bib16|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Osato</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Imai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EBV and gastric carcinoma</article-title><source>Semin Cancer Biol</source><year>1996</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>175</fpage><lpage>182</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Semin Cancer Biol||7|175||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8946601</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Raab-Traub</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epstein&#x02013;Barr virus in the pathogenesis of NPC</article-title><source>Semin Cancer Biol</source><year>2002</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>431</fpage><lpage>441</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Semin Cancer Biol||12|431||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12450729</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sam</surname><given-names>CK</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Niedobitek</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>Prasad</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Rickinson</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Analysis of EBV infection in nasopharyngeal biopsies from a group at high risk of NPC</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1993</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>957</fpage><lpage>962</lpage><!-